<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <Description>DuckDB ADO.NET Provider for C#.</Description>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
- Updated to DuckDB v1.5.6

New features:
- Typed properties for 24 DuckDB configuration options on DuckDBConnectionStringBuilder
- Read DECIMAL values that do not fit System.Decimal as BigInteger or DuckDBDecimal
- Bind BigInteger parameters wider than 128 bits to VARINT columns

Fixes:
- Fixed possible data loss on Linux and macOS when a reader opened with CommandBehavior.CloseConnection closed the last connection to a file database (#357)
- Errors in later chunks of a streaming result are now thrown instead of silently ending the result, in DuckDBDataReader and the Arrow stream (#356)
- Fixed a memory leak where results skipped with NextResult were never released
- Fixed incomplete appender rows being written with uninitialized values (#355)
- Fixed ARRAY values shifted by one row after a NULL array in the appender
- Fixed the appender writing to freed memory when a list of arrays grows
- Fixed table functions returning no rows after the first iteration of a recursive CTE (#348)

Behavior changes:
- GetFieldValue&lt;object&gt; now returns the same value as GetValue
- Reading a LIST or MAP into an untyped target (object, ArrayList, List&lt;object&gt;, or a Dictionary with object keys or values) throws InvalidCastException; use GetValue instead
- A failed ExecuteReader with CommandBehavior.CloseConnection now closes the connection, as in Npgsql
- Moving on from an incomplete appender row discards it and faults the appender: the next CreateRow or AppendRow throws, and rows completed before it are still written. Close, Dispose and Clear discard an incomplete row without an error
- A blob Stream from GetStream is valid only until the reader moves to the next result set
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
    <SignAssembly>True</SignAssembly>
    <AssemblyOriginatorKeyFile>..\keyPair.snk</AssemblyOriginatorKeyFile>
    <AllowUnsafeBlocks>true</AllowUnsafeBlocks>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(BuildType)' == 'ManagedOnly' ">
    <Description>$(Description) $(NoNativeText)</Description>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(CI)' == 'true'">
    <DefineConstants>$(DefineConstants);CI</DefineConstants>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup Condition="'$(CI)' == 'true'">
    <PackageReference Include="GitVersion.MsBuild" Version="6.4.0" PrivateAssets="all" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="DuckDB.NET.Test, " />
    <!-- The signed benchmark assembly needs internal mappings to reproduce the pre-AppendRow baseline. -->
    <InternalsVisibleTo Include="DuckDB.NET.Benchmarks, " />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Apache.Arrow" Version="23.0.0" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\DuckDB.NET.Bindings\Bindings.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
